[163.903386, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nimport mujoco, numpy as np\r\nm=mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_path('model_ref.xml')\r\nfor flag in ['mjSTATE_TIME','mjSTATE_QPOS','mjSTATE_QVEL','mjSTATE_ACT','mjSTATE_PLUGIN','mjSTATE_FULLPHYSICS','mjSTATE_INTEGRATION','mjSTATE_WARMSTART']:\r\n    v=getattr(mujoco.mjtState,flag)\r\n    print(flag,v,mujoco.mj_stateSize(m,v))\r\nprint('full eq',275)\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
