[451.476091, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[451.55746, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m29\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[451.558354, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[451.559374, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app && cat > /tmp/pgs_tol.py <<'PY'\r\nimport mujoco, numpy as np, time\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nref=Path('/app/model_ref.xml').read_text(); ins='<compiler autolimits=\"true\"/>'\r\ndef st(p,seed=0):\r\n    m=mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_path(str(p)); d=mujoco.MjData(m); rng=np.random.default_rng(seed); d.qpos += rng.normal(0,0.01,size=d.qpos.shape); \r\nmujoco.mj_forward(m,d)\r\n    for _ in range(1000): mujoco.mj_step(m,d)\r\n    s=np.zeros(276); mujoco.mj_getState(m,d,s,mujoco.mjtState.mjSTATE_FULLPHYSICS); return s\r\nrefst=st('/app/model_ref.xml')\r\ncases=[('pgs','solver=\"PGS\"'),('pgs_t1e-8','solver=\"PGS\" tolerance=\"1e-8\"'),('pgs_t1e-9','solver=\"PGS\" tolerance=\"1e-9\"'),('pgs_t1e-10','solver=\"PGS\" \r\ntolerance=\"1e-10\"'),('pgs_t1e-12','solver=\"PGS\" tolerance=\"1e-12\"'),('pgs_i10000','solver=\"PGS\" iterations=\"10000\"'),('pgs_i10000t1e-12','solver=\"PGS\" \r\niterations=\"10000\" tolerance=\"1e-12\"'),\r\n('cg_t1e-12','solver=\"CG\" tolerance=\"1e-12\"'),('newton_t1e-12','solver=\"Newton\" tolerance=\"1e-12\"')]\r\nfor name,opts in case"]
[451.559459, "o", "s:\r\n    x=ref.replace(ins,ins+f'\\n  <option {opts}/>'); p=Path('/tmp')/f'{name}.xml'; p.write_text(x)\r\n    s=st(p); md=np.max(np.abs(s-refst))\r\n    m=mujoco.MjModel.from_xml_path(str(p)); times=[]\r\n    for seed in range(5):\r\n        d=mujoco.MjData(m); rng=np.random.default_rng(seed); d.qpos += rng.normal(0,0.01,size=d.qpos.shape); mujoco.mj_forward(m,d)\r\n        t=time.perf_counter()\r\n        for _ in range(1000): mujoco.mj_step(m,d)\r\n        times.append(time.perf_counter()-t)\r\n    print(f'{name:20s} diff {md:.3e} time {np.mean(times):.5f}',flush=True)\r\nPY\r\npython /tmp/pgs_tol.py\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[451.559638, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[460.459079, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[460.459225, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\npgs                  diff 3.820e-07 time 0.13027\r\npgs_t1e-8            diff 3.820e-07 time 0.13027\r\npgs_t1e-9            diff 3.256e-07 time 0.13060\r\npgs_t1e-10           diff 3.485e-08 time 0.13039\r\npgs_t1e-12           diff 4.165e-09 time 0.13065\r\npgs_i10000           diff 3.820e-07 time 0.13051\r\npgs_i10000t1e-12     diff 4.165e-09 time 0.13053\r\ncg_t1e-12            diff 6.532e-14 time 0.21692\r\nnewton_t1e-12        diff 3.745e-15 time 0.26369\r\n\r\n"]
