[549.030763, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app && python - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nref=Path('model_ref.xml').read_text()\r\nx=ref.replace('<compiler autolimits=\"true\"/>','<compiler autolimits=\"true\"/>\\n  <option solver=\"PGS\" iterations=\"100\" tolerance=\"1e-12\"/>')\r\nPath('model.xml').write_text(x)\r\nPY\r\nfor i in 1 2 3; do echo \"=== run $i ===\"; python eval.py || exit 1; done\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[549.031116, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
