[581.427454, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m35\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[581.427732, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe model has been tuned by switching the constraint solver from Newton to PGS with a tighter convergence tolerance. This preserves the physical model and final\r\nphysics state while providing about a 2x speedup. The evaluation passed repeatedly with final state differences reported as 0.0000 and timing at roughly 49% of \r\nthe reference.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[581.428034, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
